  "text": "24 Hour Emergency Vet | BluePearl Pet Hospital | Skokie, IL\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Skokie, IL\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nSkokie, IL\n24/7 Emergency\n847.673.9110\n3735 Dempster St\nSkokie, IL 60076\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\n24/7\nPlease call ahead before visiting\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – serving Skokie and Chicagoland 24/7.\nAlong with our sister pet hospital in Northfield, we serve Skokie and the greater Chicagoland and northern suburbs, including Lincolnwood, Evanston, Wilmette, Park Ridge, Des Plaines and Chicago.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our team is ready to provide expert care in case of a pet emergency. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nIf possible, call ahead and let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary to see an emergency vet. Learn more about\nyour emergency visit\n.\nSpecialty care\nOur Skokie hospital is an emergency-only hospital, but we work closely with our\nNorthfield hospital\nfor patients in need of specialty care. Learn more about the\nspecialties offered at our Northfield hospital\n.\nSee Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinary specialists here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Skokie.\nWe are an emergency pet hospital offering treatment for serious injuries and illnesses, as well as urgent care services.\nWe have highly trained staff who use diagnostic methods such as ultrasound and x-rays for your pet. As an emergency vet and critical care service, we are fully equipped to handle your pet’s needs.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our Skokie hospital team at\n847.673.9110\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nTestimonials.\n“During the two days (my cat was hospitalized), I was treated professionally with daily updates, kindness and compassion. I am totally grateful to these skilled and professional veterinarians.” — Perry\nRead\nPerry’s full story\n.\nCurrent location.\n847.673.9110\n847.679.2884\n3735 Dempster St\nSkokie,\nIL                                    60076\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nNorthfield, IL\n820 W Frontage Rd\nNorthfield, IL 60093\n847.564.5775\n5.81 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nOak Creek, WI\n9472 S 27th St\nOak Creek, WI 53154\n414.761.6333\n58.72 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nGlendale, WI\n2100 W Silver Spring Dr\nGlendale, WI 53209\n414.540.6710\n75.35 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie